{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02643",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 5.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I mean, hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.4,
      "end_seconds": 10.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "So, come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.95,
      "end_seconds": 16.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a widespread rash with fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.66,
      "end_seconds": 24.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Okay, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.47,
      "end_seconds": 34.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "I mean, I've had it since Monday. I've had a recent new medicine too, for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.76,
      "end_seconds": 36.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "I see, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.62,
      "end_seconds": 46.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Oh, and swollen glands. That's been about the same, three weeks. With swollen glands, mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.29,
      "end_seconds": 56.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.35,
      "end_seconds": 64.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "I, I take alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.02,
      "end_seconds": 66.84,
      "duration_seconds": 0.82,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.48,
      "end_seconds": 71.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.27,
      "end_seconds": 74.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.52,
      "end_seconds": 79.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.72,
      "end_seconds": 83.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.64,
      "end_seconds": 91.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.76,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.21,
      "end_seconds": 95.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Okay, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.62,
      "end_seconds": 102.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.84,
      "end_seconds": 106.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "So, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.7,
      "end_seconds": 110.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.05,
      "end_seconds": 114.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.24,
      "end_seconds": 118.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.2,
      "end_seconds": 123.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.49,
      "end_seconds": 129.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I've had thin bones, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.44,
      "end_seconds": 135.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Okay, I can see thin bones in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.09,
      "end_seconds": 152.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "A few quick ones: mouth sores, breathing difficulty or blisters?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.5,
      "end_seconds": 157.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "No, um, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.09,
      "end_seconds": 161.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Okay, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.3,
      "end_seconds": 165.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "No, um, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.33,
      "end_seconds": 168.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.95,
      "end_seconds": 170.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.44,
      "end_seconds": 175.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.44,
      "end_seconds": 187.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.97,
      "end_seconds": 213.94,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 123 over 71, pulse is 88 beats a minute, SpO2 95 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.25,
      "end_seconds": 217.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.31,
      "end_seconds": 222.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, we'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.23,
      "end_seconds": 226.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.57,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.52,
      "end_seconds": 232.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.47,
      "end_seconds": 247.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "There is a widespread red rash, facial swelling, and your temperature is high with enlarged glands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.5,
      "end_seconds": 252.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.48,
      "end_seconds": 278.77,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a severe drug reaction, or it might be a viral rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.11,
      "end_seconds": 283.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.89,
      "end_seconds": 293.35,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a severe drug reaction do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.4,
      "end_seconds": 338.48,
      "duration_seconds": 30.08,
      "text": "Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for severe drug reaction. What I'm giving you is prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day, until review. It's for severe drug reaction. Stop the allopurinol now and you need admission. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. How would you describe the plan, so we're on the same page?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.72,
      "end_seconds": 346.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "So, I take the prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once a day. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.57,
      "end_seconds": 353.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.64,
      "end_seconds": 361.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Thank you, um, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}